21458095,2026-04-21,Debt collection,I do not know,Written notification about debt,Didn't receive notice of right to dispute,"Complaint Against LVNV Funding LLC Unlawful Credit Reporting and Failure to Provide Required Validation I am filing this complaint against LVNV Funding LLC for violations of the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act and the Fair Credit Reporting Act.

LVNV Funding placed a collection account on my credit report without ever providing me with a legally required validation notice. I have not received any written communication informing me of the alleged debt, my right to dispute it, or any documentation verifying the obligation. This failure deprived me of my statutory rights under the FDCPA.

Despite the absence of proper notice and validation, LVNV proceeded to furnish this account to the credit bureaus. This constitutes the reporting of unverified and potentially inaccurate information in violation of the FCRA. To date, LVNV has not provided sufficient evidence to establish that I am the correct consumer, that LVNV has legal ownership or authority to collect, that the amount is accurate, or that the account is legally reportable.

By reporting this unverified account, LVNV has caused harm to my credit profile, negatively impacted my ability to obtain credit, and subjected me to unnecessary financial hardship.

Fair Resolution Requested : I request that LVNV Funding LLC immediately delete this account from all consumer reporting agencies due to its failure to comply with federal law. In the alternative, if LVNV claims the account is valid, they must cease all credit reporting and collection activity until they provide full and complete validation, including : Complete account statements showing how the balance was calculated Documentation establishing a clear chain of assignment proving ownership of the alleged debt All account-level records linking me to the obligation Verification that the account is accurate and within the legal reporting period If LVNV Funding can not fully comply with these legal requirements, the account must be permanently removed and no further reporting or collection activity should occur.

I also request written confirmation of the actions taken to resolve this matter. If this issue is not corrected, I am prepared to pursue additional regulatory complaints and legal remedies. 

