21505450,2026-04-22,"Payday loan, title loan, personal loan, or advance loan",Personal line of credit,Incorrect information on your report,Account information incorrect,"To Whom It May Concern, I am submitting a formal complaint regarding inaccurate credit reporting by Kickoff Lending. My credit report currently reflects that my account with this company has been reported as 60 to 89 days late. This information is incorrect, as I have never been late on this account. 

